OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FSinger Lachi hid her low vision
OL,7,     Ffor years. But waking up one day
OL,8,     Fcompletely blind forced a
OL,9,     Freckoning, giving her courage to
OL,10,     Fown her identity and pursue music
OL,11,     Fwithout holding back.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1997, the remains of a Native
OL,14,     FAmerican chief were returned to
OL,15,     Fhis Lakota people after more than
OL,16,     Fa century in a London cemetery.
OL,17,     FHis great-granddaughter tells his
OL,18,     Fstory.
